{"4022070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SHROT", "steam_appid": 4022070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4804160], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Disclaimer</u></i></strong><i>: Demo is still in active development! We're pushing frequent updates and squashing bugs almost by the hour, so if you spot something weird, we're probably already on it.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/09f746c537bf51c33fa9af6347b6187d.poster.avif?t=1781186467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/09f746c537bf51c33fa9af6347b6187d.webm?t=1781186467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/09f746c537bf51c33fa9af6347b6187d.mp4?t=1781186467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHROT</strong> is a <strong>no-bullshit FPS</strong> (<i>boomer shooter</i>) where you and your guns kill <strong>aliens</strong>, <strong>robots</strong>, and the <strong>degenerates</strong>, all for one damn good time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No “<i>woke</i>” crap. No politics. No propaganda. No filter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal? Simple. You get home from work, crack a beer, start the game, kill everything that moves, and relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The name <strong>SHROT</strong> stands for <strong>S</strong><i>hoot</i>, <strong>H</strong><i>it</i>, <strong>R</strong><i>eload</i>, <strong>O</strong><i>verkill</i>, <strong>T</strong><i>erminate</i>. The game cuts out most of the boring cutscenes, keeping you in nonstop combat and pure adrenaline flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/401a3a55be469cd085390a9847cec6b5.poster.avif?t=1781186467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/401a3a55be469cd085390a9847cec6b5.webm?t=1781186467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RETRO SHOOTER. NO CENSORSHIP.  JUST PURE ACTION.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a truck driver with a “<i>dad bod</i>” who is Slavic by blood, American by paycheck.<br>He came to the States to drive trucks and drink beer... usually both at the same time.<br>Years of treating beer like hydration gave him a belly that enters rooms slightly before he does.<br>He finds benefit in that, as he says: “<i>The best corn grows under the hill</i>”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's not a hero. He's not special. Just another guy who woke up one day in a seriously <i>F**** up</i> situation and said: “<i>Eh, could be worse</i>.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/9e003021208fed2b41f0a496931e3773.poster.avif?t=1781186467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/9e003021208fed2b41f0a496931e3773.webm?t=1781186467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/9e003021208fed2b41f0a496931e3773.mp4?t=1781186467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some of the features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight more than <strong>47 unique enemies</strong> (including bosses)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 enemy types</strong>: <i>aliens</i>, <i>robots</i>, and <i>humans</i> experimented on by aliens, now “<i>zombified</i>,” or as he calls them, <i>degenerates</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 upgradeable weapons</strong> with their own personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level editor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-player co-op arena mode</strong> against endless enemy waves (yep, that's what the level editor is for)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alcohol, swearing, farting, and tons of &quot;<i>inappropriate&quot;</i> stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A healing system where you can <i>overheal</i>… and end up drunk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around <strong>8 hours of main gameplay</strong>, and about 35 hours to max out everything and unlock all achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/a44dc32a6429742be9cde6405f16d040.poster.avif?t=1781186467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/a44dc32a6429742be9cde6405f16d040.webm?t=1781186467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/a44dc32a6429742be9cde6405f16d040.mp4?t=1781186467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i><u>Disclaimer</u></i></strong><i>: Demo is still in active development! We're pushing frequent updates and squashing bugs almost by the hour, so if you spot something weird, we're probably already on it.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/09f746c537bf51c33fa9af6347b6187d.poster.avif?t=1781186467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/09f746c537bf51c33fa9af6347b6187d.webm?t=1781186467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/09f746c537bf51c33fa9af6347b6187d.mp4?t=1781186467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHROT</strong> is a <strong>no-bullshit FPS</strong> (<i>boomer shooter</i>) where you and your guns kill <strong>aliens</strong>, <strong>robots</strong>, and the <strong>degenerates</strong>, all for one damn good time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No “<i>woke</i>” crap. No politics. No propaganda. No filter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal? Simple. You get home from work, crack a beer, start the game, kill everything that moves, and relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The name <strong>SHROT</strong> stands for <strong>S</strong><i>hoot</i>, <strong>H</strong><i>it</i>, <strong>R</strong><i>eload</i>, <strong>O</strong><i>verkill</i>, <strong>T</strong><i>erminate</i>. The game cuts out most of the boring cutscenes, keeping you in nonstop combat and pure adrenaline flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/401a3a55be469cd085390a9847cec6b5.poster.avif?t=1781186467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/401a3a55be469cd085390a9847cec6b5.webm?t=1781186467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RETRO SHOOTER. NO CENSORSHIP.  JUST PURE ACTION.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a truck driver with a “<i>dad bod</i>” who is Slavic by blood, American by paycheck.<br>He came to the States to drive trucks and drink beer... usually both at the same time.<br>Years of treating beer like hydration gave him a belly that enters rooms slightly before he does.<br>He finds benefit in that, as he says: “<i>The best corn grows under the hill</i>”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's not a hero. He's not special. Just another guy who woke up one day in a seriously <i>F**** up</i> situation and said: “<i>Eh, could be worse</i>.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/9e003021208fed2b41f0a496931e3773.poster.avif?t=1781186467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/9e003021208fed2b41f0a496931e3773.webm?t=1781186467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022070/extras/9e003021208fed2b41f0a496931e3773.mp4?t=1781186467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some of the features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight more than <strong>47 unique enemies</strong> (including bosses)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 enemy types</strong>: <i>aliens</i>, <i>robots</i>, and <i>humans</i> experimented on by aliens, now “<i>zombified</i>,” or as he calls them, <i>degenerates</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 upgradeable weapons</strong> with their own personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level editor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-player co-op arena mode</strong> against endless enemy waves (yep, that's what the level editor is for)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alcohol, swearing, farting, and tons of &quot;<i>inappropriate&quot;</i> stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_para